  "description": "Agave 26\" 27.5\" Mountain Bike\n\nHi-Ten Steel Frame - Sturdy, durable and more speedy.\nFront Suspension Fork - Absorbs bumps for a smoother ride.\n\nDual V-brakes - Fully ensure the safety of the ride.\nProfessional Drivetrain & XC Tires - Provides precise, fast and varied shifting.\n\nDurable and Ergonomic\n\nHi-ten steel rigid frame is strong and durable, with large inertia to increase speed. Its designed frame is also in line with the structure of the human body, making riding more comfortable.\n\nSoft foam saddle ensures comfort and adjustability, thus provides you with a longer and more comfortable ride.\n\nComfortable & Safe Riding\n\nFront suspension fork absorbs any bumps and dips encountered on your path, thus it can effectively reduce the obstructive shock during a ride, thus ensuring that you have an ideal comfortable riding experience.\n\nEquipped V-brakes are lighter and easier to maintain and adjust.\n\nProfessional Drivetrain\n\nShimano 21-speed drivetrain provides precise and quick shifting with a wide range of gearing, allowing you to easily adapt to various speeds based on your riding preference.\n\nXC tires are made of non-slip and explosion-proof materials, which has strong grip and puncture resistance.\n\nAssembly & Guide\n\n85% pre-assembled, assembly tools included, easy to assemble within 25 minutes.\n\nClick on the video to see an instructional video on assembly.\n\nHigh-Carbon Steel Frame\n\nHiland high-carbon steel is extremely strong and shock resistant, provides you with a more stable operating experience during on-road or off-road riding.\n\nProfessional Drivetrain\n\nShimano 21-speed drivetrain provides precise and quick shifting, which gives you more control for climbing, descents and corners to enjoy riding.\n\nFront Suspension Fork\n\nThe steel suspension fork absorbs bumps and dips on the trail, keeping you in full control.\n\nXC Tire\n\nXC tires are made of non-slip and explosion-proof materials, which have strong grip and puncture resistance.\n\nMaster any trail with the Hiland Agave Mountain Bike. Featuring a durable high-carbon steel frame, 21-speed drivetrain, and reliable V-brakes for ultimate control and comfort.",
